[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    100[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Axis 4 — entry-point levels
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    101[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    102[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The C exposes four *different* levels of API for the same work. Every level is
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    103[0m:[38;5;10m[49m driven directly, not only the one-shot wrappers:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    104[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    105[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - **L0 one-shot:** `ZSTD_compress`, `ZSTD_decompress`, `ZSTD_compress2`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    106[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `ZSTD_compressCCtx`, `ZSTD_decompressDCtx`, `ZSTD_compress_usingDict`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    107[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `ZSTD_compress_advanced`, `ZSTD_compress_usingCDict(_advanced)`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    108[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `ZSTD_decompress_usingDict`, `ZSTD_decompress_usingDDict`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    109[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - **L1 streaming:** `ZSTD_compressStream2` / `ZSTD_compressStream` /
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    110[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `ZSTD_flushStream` / `ZSTD_endStream`, `ZSTD_decompressStream`, plus the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    111[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `ZSTD_initCStream*` / `ZSTD_initDStream*` families.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    112[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - **L2 block-by-block ("buffer-less"):** `ZSTD_compressBegin*` /
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    113[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `ZSTD_compressContinue` / `ZSTD_compressEnd`, `ZSTD_decompressBegin*` /
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    114[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `ZSTD_nextSrcSizeToDecompress` / `ZSTD_decompressContinue` /
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    115[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `ZSTD_nextInputType`, and the raw `ZSTD_compressBlock` /
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    116[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `ZSTD_decompressBlock` / `ZSTD_insertBlock`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    117[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - **L3 entropy primitives (lowest level):** `FSE_*` (`FSE_count`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    118[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `FSE_normalizeCount`, `FSE_writeNCount`, `FSE_readNCount`, `FSE_buildCTable*`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    119[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `FSE_buildDTable*`, `FSE_compress*`, `FSE_decompress*`, `FSE_optimalTableLog`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    120[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `FSE_NCountWriteBound`, …), `HUF_*` (`HUF_compress*`, `HUF_decompress*`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    121[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `HUF_readStats*`, `HUF_buildCTable*`, `HUF_readDTableX1/X2`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    122[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `HUF_getNbBitsFromCTable`, …), `HIST_count*`, `ZSTD_XXH32/64*`, `POOL_*`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    123[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `ZSTD_customMalloc/Calloc/Free`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    124[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
